ment. You're helping him build paths through the labyrinth to get to other departments at Hoard's. Barry is learning about the issues his coworkers are facing and learns about collective bargaining.", "summary": "Hoard\u2019s LLC is a cozy, story-driven puzzle game where you play as Barry, a mild-mannered minotaur working deep in the depths of a corporate dungeon. When Barry starts to realize his coworkers are being exploited, he sets out to do something truly radical: help them.\n\nNavigate a maze of departments\u2014like Loot Logistics and Monster Resources\u2014solving puzzles to reconnect isolated coworkers. Along the way, you'll uncover endearing stories, roll your eyes at cheesy corporate puns, and bring together a community that needs each other now more than ever.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/hoards-llc-limited-labyrinth-corporation", "videos": [{"id": 150591, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "-4VMWSvID_I", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-4VMWSvID_I", "title": "Hoard's LLC - Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-4VMWSvID_I/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 181270, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "DOzFh74Mq1s", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DOzFh74Mq1s", "title": "Hoard's LLC: Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DOzFh74Mq1s/uhddefault.jpg"}]}